        "2605": { n: "Temperature-humidity regime", t: "SP 70.13330.2012, cl. 5.4.1, 5.11.17, 5.12.3. Not below +5°C. Drafts are not permitted. When installing floors over uninsulated slabs, the air temperature in the room below must be not below +5°C. Keep moist under a film layer for not less than 7 days." },
