        "2710": { n: "Control of adhesive application", t: "SP 293.1325800.2017, cl.8.2.3.2. Mortar is applied to the board in a 5–8 cm wide, 1–2 cm thick strip around the full perimeter of the board, set back 2–3 cm from the edges, plus 3–6 additional dabs in the central part. No adhesive on board ends." },
