        "2718": { n: "Anchoring of mineral-wool boards", t: "Internal company standard (SP 293.1325800.2017 cl.8.2.4.1 does not contain such fixed figures - the anchor count/pattern is set by the project; the minimum of 5 pcs/m² is in cl.7.35.1, zone-based calculation is via the Annex B formula). Field zone: height ≤40 m - 5 pcs. per m²; height > 40 m - 6 pcs. per m². Edge zone from 1.2 to 2 m: height ≤16 m - 5 pcs. per m²; height > 16 but ≤40 m - 8 pcs. per m²; height > 40 m - 10 pcs. per m²." },
        "2719": { n: "Installation of the disc-type dowel with anchor", t: "SP 293.1325800.2017 (with Amendment No.1/2), Table 8.2 \"Controlled parameters for ETICS installation\": the disc must be flush with the board surface or recessed not more than 2 mm. Thermal head undamaged." },
        "2720": { n: "Adhesive-mix preparation", t: "Internal company standard (Ceresit CT 190 technical data sheet: clean container, water dosage). Mixing is done in a clean container. The water-to-adhesive ratio is observed." },
