        "2722": { n: "Control of the reinforced base-coat thickness", t: "SP 293.1325800.2017 cl.8.2.5.4. Base-coat thickness 3-4 mm (or with a 10 mm notched trowel). Additional-coat thickness 1-2 mm. The fibreglass mesh must protrude at least 1 mm." },
